rievance platform since the farm laws, now backed by concrete price evidence. India's structural paradox deepens: its diplomatic apparatus operates at historical maximum intensity while its economic fundamentals face their sharpest external squeeze in years; its security doctrine maintains maximum deterrent declaratory posture while its institutional forum (BRICS) fails to produce consensus; and its technology statecraft achieves landmark milestones (ASML) while its fiscal space narrows.",
